<section class="come-play">
  <h2>Come play</h2>
  <p>Numina is a real live-action roleplay campaign that meets in person. If you
  have read this far and want to stand in it rather than read about it, these
  three links are the whole path in.</p>
  <ul class="come-play__links">
    <li><a href="{{ site.official.website }}" rel="external">The official Numina site</a> — the event schedule, what a weekend costs, and where it is held.</li>
    <li><a href="{{ site.official.registration }}" rel="external">Registration</a> — sign up for an event and read your Post-Event Letters.</li>
    <li><a href="{{ site.official.discord }}" rel="external">The Numina Discord</a> — ask anything, borrow gear or a costume, arrange a ride, or say you would like to come NPC.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="come-play__tip">Say it is your first event when you get in touch. That is the whole trick.</p>
</section>
